gambatte-pico patch to upstream gambatte (libgambatte/include/gambatte.h, libgambatte/src/gambatte.cpp,
gambatte-memory.h, interrupter.h, interrupter.cpp, mem/cartridge.h and mem/cartridge.cpp), GPL-2.0
like the files it changes. Copyright (c) 2026 TheGammaSqueeze. Applied by build.sh to a copy in out/src.

Cheat codes for the LK, after 0001 left the std::string setters empty: a Game Genie code and a
GameShark code each come in as plain characters (addGameGenie, addGameShark), decoded by gambatte's
own code for them, so no std::string is built. The caller (pico/pico_bridge.cpp) has checked each
code's form and split a cheat into its codes.

